(text_box "After the required VIN-VUSB cut, USB alone does not power the Teensy or the 5 V rail. 12 V (and the 20 A fuse) is required for logging and programming. With 12 V on and E-stop open, Teensy and sensors stay up; valves stay off." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 58.000 174.800 0) (size 310.000 7.200) (margins 0.7 0.3 0.7 0.3) (stroke (width 0.1524) (type solid)) (fill (type none)) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d3b5fa4a-7a13-46ac-8947-abd60296ad54"))
